  "_spellbook_doc": "Six spellbook slots (LMB, RMB, Q, E, R, F) hold any six known spells, from any sphere; changed at the Orrery shrine. Bolts fire while held; every other spell aims while held and casts on release. The Magick (C) is the first Magick whose two spheres are both in the book.",
  "start_spellbook": ["ember_bolt", "pebble", "pillar", "fling", "pyroclasm", "avalanche"],
  "_aether_doc": "Aether is the mana (design/magic-world-revisit.md section 8). Cost by spell kind unless a spell sets its own 'aether'. Cadence: the same spell cast again in a row loses 'repeat_loss' per repeat down to 'floor'; a cast that differs from the last one, where at least one of the two is not a Bolt, adds a note and refunds 'refund' Aether. At 'notes' notes the next non-Bolt spell is Resonant (size x 'resonant_size', counts + 'resonant_count'). Notes fade after 'note_life' seconds without a cast.",
  "aether": {"max": 100, "regen": 12, "costs": {"bolt": 0, "control": 20, "signature": 45, "magick": 50}},
  "_overdraw_doc": "Short on Aether, a spell still casts: the missing Aether is paid in HP ('hp_per_aether' each) and the spell is locked for 'lock' seconds. A desperate option, never the efficient one.",
  "overdraw": {"hp_per_aether": 0.5, "lock": 10.0},
  "cadence": {"repeat_loss": 0.15, "floor": 0.55, "notes": 4, "refund": 10, "note_life": 3.0, "resonant_size": 1.3, "resonant_count": 1},
  "_dodge_doc": "A circle telegraph the wizard places never lands faster than a wizard-speed target can leave it: delay >= reaction + (radius + wizard radius) / wizard speed (design/magic-world-revisit.md section 3).",
  "dodge": {"reaction": 0.25},
